Beyond these, every **launcher** — an entry in the `launchers` list of
{{.Env.ActionsPath}} — is bindable under `launcher.<launcher-id>`, unbound
until you bind it. A launcher with `id: lazygit` is bound with
`launcher.lazygit: [alt+g]`, and the chord opens the pop-up terminal straight
into that program, in the checkout of the session on screen. Any launcher
already configured appears in the table above.

Nothing else in the app is bindable — switching profiles, selecting a feed,
jumping to a node is data rather than a command.
